-- Dark Chaos - backfill dc_pet_definitions.icon for every pet that had none.
--
-- Found 2026-09-02: 1849 of 1898 pet rows in the collection CDBC carried an EMPTY icon
-- (every generator wrote ''), so DC-Collection fell through GetItemIcon to the one
-- ItemDisplayInfo all custom cages share (68747 = Ability_Mount_NetherdrakePurple) and
-- every pet showed the same raptor head.
--
-- Sources, in order of confidence:
--   custom pets  : retail BattlePetSpecies.IconFileDataID, joined on (model path +
--                  TextureVariation triple), falling back to the model family's icon
--   stock pets   : the stock cage item's own ItemDisplayInfo.InventoryIcon_1
--   16 leftovers : retail species matched by name (cat carriers, renamed seal folders)
-- Values are bare Interface\Icons names; the CDBC generator prefixes the path. Every
-- BLP was probed against BOTH the root chain and enGB; the 445 not present were
-- extracted from CASC and deployed to patch-F.
-- Guarded `AND icon=''` so a deliberately curated icon is never overwritten; idempotent.

UPDATE `dc_pet_definitions` SET `icon`='INV_Crate_01' WHERE `pet_entry`=4401 AND (`icon` IS NULL OR `icon`='');
